        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-[20px] tracking-[-0.01em] mt-8 mb-3">Cross-platform fatigue strategy</h3>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">The insight (hook, angle, messaging) from a winning ad transfers across platforms. The execution must be refreshed per platform. When a TikTok creative fatigues at week 2, its concept can be re-shot in a Meta-native style and run fresh there. When the Meta version fatigues at week 4, the same concept can be adapted for YouTube with a longer format. This staggered approach extends the total value extracted from each winning concept.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">See our <a href="/performance-creative" class="text-accent hover:underline">performance creative guide</a> for the full cross-platform production system.</p>
